  m_text: 'The Rose Princess, but you can call her Rose.  She looks a lot like the
    dolls Gran used to have at her house. She is kind, elegant and graceful, just
    like Gran was. Rose just wants to shield you and the Others, she knows how much
    they''re hurting. She has been keeping the memories and the Others at bay, but
    she can see your ready to face it all. '
